MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Applied docs/ui-gap.md fixes across the 4 existing screens (Main/Summary/
Compare/Detail): light/dark theme toggle via CSS custom properties, real
footer links to mee1080/umasim and this repo, and renamed "基準との差" to
"基準スナップショット比" on Summary to resolve the naming collision with
Compare's "基準" column.

Added two new mockups the design hadn't drawn yet (per design/README.md's
"まだ描いていないもの"): Error.dc.html (エラー・中断と再開, grounded in
Notices.tsx/store.ts cancel semantics) and Solve.dc.html (逆算・組み合わせ探索,
grounded in Inverse.tsx/Optimize.tsx), plus a 5th 探索 nav tab across all
6 screens and the corresponding canvas.json layout.

These are mockup sources only (design/*.dc.html); the app implementation
in apps/web is a separate follow-up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016eF6tmHVpig3DhC3Qnx8mo
